# WTWR (What to Wear?) - Project Learning Summary

## Project Setup and Structure

###Initial Setup

Created with Vite + React for modern development experience
Used ESLint and Prettier for code quality
Implemented BEM methodology for CSS organization

### Project Structure

- src/components: Reusable UI components
- src/pages: Route-specific pages
- src/utils: API requests and utility functions
- src/App.jsx: Main application component
- src/index.jsx: Entry point for the application

### API Integration

- Used fetch for HTTP requests
- Implemented JWT authentication for secure API access
- Handled error handling and status codes
